 "generatorWeaknesses": [
  "GIVE with an entity word whose icon is the gift (cat + cod) prints \"고양이에게 고양이를 줘요\"; the batch teaches the cat on a LOOK step and gives a salmon.",
  "PLAYER_REL resolves the anchor as a block/item before an entity, so chicken reads as the raw chicken item; the batch uses cow.",
  "The ceremony sentence ignores the taught word and speaks registry names (우유 양동이, 참나무 울타리 옆에 참나무 울타리 문); SentenceDumpTest allows only about 2 authored finale lines in the whole tree, so the batch picked goals whose ceremony reads well.",
  "PLACE_REL names a log anchor 통나무, never 나무 (the concept tree owns no block); the 나무 clues are authored.",
  "BUILD_PATTERN and PLACE_ON_PATTERN have no status line, so wave-1/2 trails need an unmet condition (HOLDING, IN_BIOME) on those steps.",
  "No level-1 sentence for 올라가다 / 들어가다; coverage lexicon does not know 쌓다, 들다 and the irregular 걷다 (걸어요)."
 ]
}
